Package: BGS
Title: British Geology at a Point
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Martin R.", "Smith", , "martin.smith@durham.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5660-1727"))
Description: Reports the bedrock, superficial deposits and seabed sediments
    mapped by the British Geological Survey at given points, located by
    latitude and longitude, British National Grid coordinates or Ordnance
    Survey grid references. Contains the 1:625 000 onshore geological map and
    the 1:250 000 seabed sediment map of the UK, released under the Open
    Government Licence, so needs neither GIS software nor an internet
    connection. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the British Geological
    Survey.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Copyright: Map data in 'inst/extdata' (c) UKRI, under the Open Government
    Licence v3.0; see file 'inst/COPYRIGHTS'.
URL: https://github.com/geol-skills/BGS
BugReports: https://github.com/geol-skills/BGS/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    spelling,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/Needs/coverage: covr
